; The ring of twelve crosses: how many are shown, and a completion flag
;
; State of the crosses routine #R$AE4B, which runs in rooms 24 and 25 (script op $9F) once all 12 crosses are
; collected (#R$854D). Every 5 frames it increments the count (while the chalice is not taken, #R$8521) and re-stamps
; that many crosses (tile $4C) at the positions listed from #R$82D7, so that the ring of twelve crosses appears one
; cross at a time with sound 5. The values survive leaving the room, so on a later visit the whole ring is drawn at
; once. Zeroed at the start of a game.
; .
; +0 CrossRingCount: crosses of the ring drawn so far, 0-12
; +1 CrossRingDone: set to 12 when the twelfth cross appears and cleared by #R$BB57 when Satan is turned into smoke;
; no code reads it
@label=CrossRingCount
g$8541 DEFB $00
@label=CrossRingDone
 $8542 DEFB $00
